</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>BatMud Interviews</H1>

<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> -- Ssmud -- </H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<blockquote>
<pre></tt>
<b>Ssmud was interviewed on October 21, 2005.</b>


Ssmud Vayne is a level 86 mortal of the Duck race.
She was created Wed Sep 15 21:56:41 1999 and she is 1y, 59d, 3h, 41min and 59s old.
She has been on for 7h, 57min and 31s, not idle.
She has killed: Timmy O'Toole, stuck in the well, 65651 exp
                Jane, the Goddess, 1019432 exp (party of 9)
Web page: {260m} Exprate: 425.329      Music Cast: http://69.113.67.1:8000
This player has a blog - last modified 1d, 56min and 1s ago. 
Plan:
>          5 Type Conju-Mage *Mana* *Poison* *Electric* *Acid* *Cold*
>                  (~1570 sp, Int: Divine (375+++), Nice tick)
>             Ask for exp/eq/cash party anytime, usually up for it



<br><br><br>
<br><br><HR WIDTH="100%">


<b>Tell us a little about yourself.</b>

Simple guy, like to do normal guy stuff.  I work at Best buy, I'm 21, and 
I have a hot sexy mudder girlfriend.



<b>When did you start playing Bat?</b>

1999.


<b>What were you doing in life at the time?</b>

High school.


<b>How long have you been playing Bat?  What's gone on in your life during that time?</b>

7 years or so.  I finished high school, got a job, etc.


<b>How did you originally find BatMud?</b>

Friends were playing, so I tried it.


<b>What's been your favorite 'incarnation' here on Bat?</b>

Conjumage.


<b>Describe your current character.</b>

260m, conjumagess+, duck, booned, good tick, nice stats.


<b>How do you like to spend your time on BatMud? </b>

Exp/Eq/Chatting, whatever.  I spend most of my free time on Bat.


<b>What's your favorite area on Bat, and why?</b>

Probably trilloch zoo, fun area, good exp.


<b>What is your least favorit area on Bat?  Why?</b>

Zonni Swamps, at least as a mage with no hps.  :D


<b>Have you done many Random Acts of Kindness here?</b>

I might have gave some newbie some eq once or twice.


<b>How about the opposite -- how eeeeevil have you been?</b>

I dont really get into messing with people/etc.


<b>Would you ever wiz here?  Why/why not?</b>

Maybe.  I'd like to contribute to this game some time, and I have 
a few ideas ...


<b>Have you earned TPs here?  What sorts of things were you rewarded for?</b>

I donated for some and got some from random wizards.  The last one was for 
making a wiz laugh hard.  :D


<b>Who are some of your favorite players on Bat? </b>

Well my friends lists are too long to really go on here, but most of 
the people I've met in real life or talk to on teamspeak/skype rock.


<b>Have you met many players and wizzes "in real life"? </b>

Yeah, at Campcon.  Woooo!!


<b>What motivates you to play on the mud?</b>

It's fun, friends play, chatting.


<b>What recent tunes have you most liked?</b>

Exp pool, I guess.  Free exp always rocks. 


<b>What recent tunes have you least liked?</b>

Well, I guess wear and tear.  I think if your int or so is high, 
you should at least notice your shit disintegrating.


<b>What changes would you most like to see made in the mud?</b>

Hrm, the game is fine, leave it be.


<b>If you were a wiz, what are some of the areas you would develop?</b>

